# Privacy Policy

**Last updated:** 2025-01-01

## Overview

This Privacy Policy describes how the FIDO BLE HID application ("the App") handles your information.

## Information We Collect

The App collects account information solely for the purpose of authentication and login. This may include:

- Account credentials (e.g., usernames, public key material)
- FIDO/passkey registration data associated with your accounts

## How Your Data Is Stored

All data collected by the App is stored **locally on your device only**. No data is transmitted to, or stored on, any remote server operated by the developers of this App.

## Data Deletion

All data stored by the App is permanently deleted when you uninstall the App from your device. No residual data is retained after uninstallation.

## Third-Party Access

We do not sell, share, or transfer your data to any third parties.

## Changes to This Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date above.

## Contact

If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please open an issue in the project repository.
